            <ArticleTitle>Two nanoscale Nb containing polyoxometalates based on {P2W15Nb3O62} clusters and chromium cations.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>13345-13348</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7dt02737k</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two novel mixed-addenda Nb/W polyoxometalates are successfully fabricated, and investigated as anode materials for lithium-ion batteries. For the Cs5K4{Cr3(H2O)12[P2W15Nb3O62]2}·60H2O sample, a reversible capacity (466.6 mA h g-1) and stable cycle performance are obtained.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
